# Agent loops

| Loop | Question | Owner |
|------|----------|-------|
| Strict TDD | Does the code match intended behavior? | Implementer |
| Verify | Were tests and spec followed? | Implementer |
| Adversarial review | Does the contract lie? | Implementer; Security when triggered |

Prefer behavior-first tests. Do not weaken asserts to force green.
